{
  "id": 8834791506119,
  "title": "Personalized and Romance Music Player Interface Quilt with Photo",
  "handle": "personalized-and-romance-music-player-interface-quilt-with-photo-b8a3dc4155-b8a3dc4155",
  "body_html": "<p>Elevate your home decor with a personalized touch from Jeminise. This custom quilt features a unique music player interface design, allowing you to showcase your cherished photos and custom text. Crafted from a comfortable cotton blend with high-quality silk floss filling, this lightweight yet cozy quilt provides the perfect balance of warmth for all seasons. Whether draped over a bed, used as a sofa throw, or given as a sentimental family gift, this beautiful keepsake brings warmth and memories to any space.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with your own photos, song name, artist name, and custom text to create a one-of-a-kind keepsake.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Music Player Theme:</strong> Features a romantic music player interface design with soundwaves, progress bar, and media control motifs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>All-Season Comfort:</strong> Made with a lightweight, breathable cotton blend exterior and filled with premium silk floss for cozy warmth.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for indoor or outdoor use, including beds, couches, backyard lounging, camping, or picnics.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable and quick-drying for hassle-free maintenance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Optional Components:</strong> Available in multiple sizes from Throw to King, with the option to add matching customized pillowcases.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Cotton Blend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester &amp; Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Silk Floss</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Music Moment</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Bohemian</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Music and romance</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Quilt, Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>3 images, 3 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw, Twin, Full, Queen, King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All, Spring, Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
